WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.199 --> 00:00:04.200
If Godzilla comes to mind when asked who you
think is at the top of the reptilian food

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:05.819
chain - think again.

00:00:05.819 --> 00:00:08.660
You may be very - VERY mistaken.

00:00:08.660 --> 00:00:13.660
SCP-682, also known as the Hard to Destroy
Reptile, is one of the most deadly and infamous

00:00:13.660 --> 00:00:16.480
creatures on the SCP Foundation’s roster.

00:00:16.480 --> 00:00:18.550
But what makes this beast so feared?

00:00:18.550 --> 00:00:22.200
First, as the name suggests, it’s pretty
much impossible to kill.

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:28.670
Multiple cross-tests with other SCPs - from
SCP-173 to SCP-096 - have heavily injured

00:00:28.670 --> 00:00:33.400
the creature, but it has a remarkable ability
to adapt to and overcome seemingly any form

00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:35.340
of attack leveraged against it.

00:00:35.340 --> 00:00:39.740
It often even goes a step further, and weaponizes
what was used against it by taking on it’s

00:00:39.740 --> 00:00:41.740
opponents anomalous ability itself!

00:00:41.740 --> 00:00:45.530
Second, it’s both highly intelligent and
incredibly malicious.

00:00:45.530 --> 00:00:49.829
It claims to find all life disgusting, and
if it had its way, it would happily slaughter

00:00:49.829 --> 00:00:51.250
any and every living thing.

00:00:51.250 --> 00:00:55.480
It’s kept in a tank of highly potent acid
to prevent its escape, and it’s believed

00:00:55.480 --> 00:00:58.540
to be a potential offspring of the infamous
Scarlet King.

